# Handlebars Templates

- All templates use `.hbs` extension with Handlebars syntax
- Partials in `src/_includes/` — reference as `{{> partialName}}` (no path/extension)
- Layouts in `src/_layouts/` — set via frontmatter `layout: base.hbs`
- Use `{{{ content }}}` (triple braces) for unescaped HTML output
- Use `{{> card ...}}` with named params: `title`, `content`, `buttonText`, `buttonLink`, `primary`, `openNew`, `cardDate`
- DaisyUI component classes (`card`, `btn`, `collapse`, `navbar`, etc.) — see existing partials for patterns
- Alternate card colors: `{{#if (remainder @index 2)}}` for primary, `{{else}}` for secondary
- New pages need `layout` and `title` in frontmatter
